<title>PHILIPPINES: Basketball - Shell, Alaska rout challengers in PBA.</title>
<headline>Basketball - Shell, Alaska rout challengers in PBA.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of qualifying round of the Philippine Basketball Association third conference, with one American import in each team, played on Friday night:</p>
<p>Alaska Milk beat Mobiline Cellulars 117-107 (52-47)</p>
<p>Formula Shell beat Purefoods Corned Beef 99-91 (40-43)</p>
</text>
